; One payment: the whole trace is a run of the first sequence with the outcome
; Done (the prohibition completes at once), but its status is OPEN: a sequence
; that has reached a prohibition stays under observation to the end of the
; trace. The second sequence, which needs two payments, is not done; the third
; is done at entry 1, when Alice pays after the prohibition.
(scenario sequence_one_payment
  (spec "examples/core/core_sequence.triel")
  (entry "2026-06-01T09:00:00Z" (activate)
    (data))
  (entry "2026-06-01T10:00:00Z" (act alice pay must)
    (data)))
